{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3001_p", "source_sha256": "d7891a43fa832747be83e429444c915aaa31282e5ebef81f6b333492ef067eb4", "ja": "（これから、可憐とスタジオ入りだけど……。\nずいぶん、ソワソワしてるな。どうしたんだろう？）", "zh": "（接下来要和可怜进入摄影棚……\n但她看来相当心神不宁，是怎么了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3002_045kar", "source_sha256": "cbb0486cd3a29b6384c1d003e8190169fc8848d05ab303f93f9c279ed951f200", "ja": "も、モデルさんって……みんな、すらりとして、\n華やかな方ばかりですよね……。", "zh": "模、模特儿……每一位都是\n身材苗条又耀眼迷人吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3003_045kar", "source_sha256": "90e2064f03e99bb6316776b9363ee6205f7eaa89dc12618ddbb0dc65ffdc30e5", "ja": "私がやったら……み、見劣りしないでしょうか……？\nその……私、見かけだけで……地味、ですし……。", "zh": "要是我来当模特儿……会、会不会相形见绌呢……？\n那个……毕竟我的外表……比较不起眼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3004_p", "source_sha256": "5619c831287bb1ffe134ee2905fccca0b0c10a6077f9eeeb1e3b4a7b02262004", "ja": "（モデルの仕事に対して、不安があるみたいだな。\nなんとか、元気づけてあげないと……）", "zh": "（看来她对模特儿的工作感到不安呢，\n得让她打起精神才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3005", "source_sha256": "4622fae41e87da3a7c4ab83654d65bc334d089a11fa7d2ca758fe433767ef735", "ja": "頭をなでる", "zh": "摸头", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3006", "source_sha256": "df1af5c916489649faee94958dd76120c3ef79c6c6a4bfda929c351f46c2ed55", "ja": "肩をたたく", "zh": "拍肩膀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3100_p", "source_sha256": "76a5970736edc494cdae5680dc482440eec5cd9436409e5a2c9f312073a35a69", "ja": "大丈夫だ、可憐！　可憐の綺麗さは、モデルさん達にも\nまったく引けを取らない。俺が保証するよ。", "zh": "没事的，可怜！可怜的美丽绝对不比\n模特儿逊色，我可以保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3101_045kar", "source_sha256": "956d5c658c57f0ee99d9fd65794c458a7b015b3927ab8a6338187f07424c06a3", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さんの手、\n大きいですね……なんだか、ホッとします……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生的手\n真大呢……让人感到很安心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3102_045kar", "source_sha256": "1aa424f5becbd0fd7fe76bf9853f1d2c219d13c8d2bd4784459e049ef428a1ce", "ja": "まだ少し不安ですけど……{$P$}さん\nに支えてもらえるなら、私……頑張れそうです……！", "zh": "虽然还有点不安……但只要{$P$}先生\n支持我，我……就能努力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3200_p", "source_sha256": "76a5970736edc494cdae5680dc482440eec5cd9436409e5a2c9f312073a35a69", "ja": "大丈夫だ、可憐！　可憐の綺麗さは、モデルさん達にも\nまったく引けを取らない。俺が保証するよ。", "zh": "没事的，可怜！可怜的美丽绝对不比\n模特儿逊色，我可以保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3201_045kar", "source_sha256": "03b2c6810cfd83cfb937380c827fb84f3faff71d10b176bf1ee66d05ba2c63b7", "ja": "ひゃっ……！？　ご、ごめんなさい……。\nいきなりだったので、び、びっくりしてしまって……。", "zh": "呀啊……！？对、对不起……\n因为太突然了，我、我吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3202_045kar", "source_sha256": "07d6b1b94cfee7cd05bb9aea5367bd1bb70e21211179e0097538b05c8ba9a36a", "ja": "ど、どうしよう……。さ、さっきよりも、\n心臓がドキドキしてきちゃいました……。", "zh": "怎、怎么办……\n心脏跳得比刚刚还要更快了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3300_p", "source_sha256": "d334ffae9836409842d8501914d83fabb45a8b7ddd41320ea22015b6617970eb", "ja": "心配な気持ちはわかるけど、怖がらなくていい。\n可憐なら、きっとやりきれるよ。", "zh": "我可以理解你的担忧，但不用害怕，\n可怜一定能顺利完成的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3301_045kar", "source_sha256": "27f896c192f6d121ca16bbbcff1d193bc7e6f9fbd5adddf09848b422a9881b7a", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nは……励ましてくれて、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢……谢谢你的鼓励……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3302_045kar", "source_sha256": "0db5cd1469821b808fc45b0c4ff3a571e402bf75edab6428e659f7444ecbd33a", "ja": "不思議ですね……プロデューサーさんが近くにいると、\nそれだけで……心が、落ち着きます。てへへ……♪", "zh": "真不可思议……光是有制作人先生待在我身边……\n就会觉得心情很平静，嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3400_p", "source_sha256": "d334ffae9836409842d8501914d83fabb45a8b7ddd41320ea22015b6617970eb", "ja": "心配な気持ちはわかるけど、怖がらなくていい。\n可憐なら、きっとやりきれるよ。", "zh": "我可以理解你的担忧，但不用害怕，\n可怜一定能顺利完成的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3401_045kar", "source_sha256": "99bb5e5c6a4ac0a639940bacc7c1c4632f374a1a40ab530de8b0c1051754ee49", "ja": "わ、私……まだ、そこまで自分のこと、\n信じられませんけど……。", "zh": "虽、虽然……我还没办法这么\n相信自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_3402_045kar", "source_sha256": "37b7b844364ddf02d4942285fb70a2bd3b0d84233b4b8190e7d8c6120144d543", "ja": "でも……励ましてくれる{$P$}さんの\n優しさには……こ、応えたいです……。", "zh": "但……我想回应鼓励我的{$P$}先生，\n你的……温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
